request 立替(outlay) v1 "立替"
description "営業部の人が出し、上長が確かめる立替（架空）。経理部が受け持つが、組織にそのチームは無い"
owner accounting

use organization 組織(org) from "shared/小さい会社.ringi"

form
  金額(amount) : money[円] "金額"  range >=1円 <=100_000円

route
  確認(check)  上長

who
  上長(manager) = manager of requester

ticket
  submitted by   everyone in sales
  self approval  not allowed
